      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS misses analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹24.83 (down from ₹32.46 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹249.3b (up 2.3% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹16.9b (down 24% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.8% (down from 9.0% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 7.4%. Revenue is forecast to grow 11% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Consumer Durables industry in India.",
