      "title": "LG Electronics India Limited Announces Appointment of Jongha Hwang as Chief Strategy Officer, Effective January 16, 2026",
      "body": "LG Electronics India Limited appointed Mr. Jongha Hwang as Chief Strategy Officer (CSO) of the Company as Senior Management Personnel with effect from January 16, 2026. Mr. Jongha Hwang holds a Master’s Degree in Business Administration (MBA) from aSSIST University, South Korea. He has over 29 years of extensive experience across strategy and market intelligence functions. Mr. Jongha Hwang has previously worked with LG Electronics Inc. (Korea), where he was responsible for Market Intelligence and analysis of industry trends aligned with the Company’s strategic objectives.",
