      "date": "2025-12-18T11:30:00.000Z",
      "title": "aiMotive and LG to Unveil Advanced Integrated IVI/ADAS Contractor At CES 2026",
      "body": "aiMotive in collaboration with LG, will introduce a next-generation High-Performing Computing (HPC) Lite platform at CES 2026. Designed to support advanced driver assistance and in-vehicle experiences, the platform integrates LG's In-Vehicle Infotainment (IVI) system and Advanced Driver assistance System (ADAS) in a single controller. aiMotive and LG have been working together on the new HPC platform since May of this year. The HPC platform acts as a central processing unit for the vehicle, consolidating multiple functions into LG's HPC Electronic Control Unit (ECU). The ECU features aiMotive's aiDrive software solution. The integrated aiMotive solution supports Level 2+ automated navigation-assisted driving on highways and eligible secondary roads, leveraging a multi-camera, multi-radar s",
